{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"a8153a6b9d696e0fa75f9872bf702a7e4bbd08729621ade38e74c1f1d4829836","digest":{"component_or_area":"CompletionAgentStep._recover (completion recovery workflow)","key_entities":["CompletionAgentStep._recover","src/rebar/llm/workflow/completion_recovery.py","show_ticket","_reads.show_ticket","LLMBudgetExhaustedError","RebarError","failure_diagnostic","raise_completion_workflow_failure","aggregate_* keys","CompletionRecoveryError","stage=\"preflight\""],"problem_keywords":["completion recovery","prelude failure","diagnostic loss","error handling","LLMBudgetExhaustedError"],"propositions":["A RebarError raised by show_ticket in the prelude escapes the try block and causes failure_diagnostic to remain None, dropping primary run's budget and repetition diagnostic.","The prelude show_ticket call executes before the try block that builds failure_diagnostic, so prelude failures bypass the existing error handling path that preserves primary diagnostics.","Moving show_ticket inside the existing try block causes prelude failures to land in the stage=\"preflight\" arm, which prefixes and preserves the primary diagnostic including aggregate_* keys.","Current behavior produces a bare-LLMError branch with no gate error sidecar on prelude failures, resulting in total evidence loss for narrow trigger conditions."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b2b5c498-2f67-4ae3-bafc-eca40294bec2","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787357084862900566,"uuid":"7b872aa9-afc9-468c-a461-c43934f0b26d"}